  "summary": "McMaster disclosed 29 transactions dated Aug. 7, 2025, to May 14, 2026, consisting of 18 purchases (estimated $548K) and 11 sales (estimated $638K). Four sales of ASGN, Inc. (ASGN) dated August 2025 appeared in a report OGE posted Sept. 9, 2026, more than a year after the trades; the filing itself marks them as received more than 30 days late. His five most recent purchases, dated May 13 and May 14, 2026, were Akamai (AKAM), Corning (GLW), Fluence Energy (FLNC), Qualcomm (QCOM) and Forgent Power (FPS). 19 of the 29 transactions, or 66 percent, were flagged as filed late.",
